<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:29:17 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>人工智能对毕业论文写作的影响：以越南公立大学英语专业为例</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/the-impact-of-artificial-intelligence-on-graduation-thesis-writing-a-case-study-of-english-majors-at-a-vietnamese-public-university</link><description>PDF | 2025 年 1 月 1 日，Vo Thi Thu Thao 发表了在 ResearchGate 上查找、阅读并引用您需要的所有研究&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-impact-of-artificial-intelligence-on-graduation-thesis-writing-a-case-study-of-english-majors-at-a-vietnamese-public-university3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:29:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/the-impact-of-artificial-intelligence-on-graduation-thesis-writing-a-case-study-of-english-majors-at-a-vietnamese-public-university</guid></item><item><title>受儿童学习方式的启发，新的人工智能框架学会从观察中对世界进行理论化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/inspired-by-how-children-learn-new-ai-framework-learns-to-theorize-the-world-from-observations</link><description>KAIST 研究团队开发了下一代世界模型，这是人工智能为理解和预测世界而构建的内部模型，仅从观察中学习可执行的理论。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/inspired-by-how-children-learn-new-ai-framework-learns-to-theorize-the-world-from-observations2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:14:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/inspired-by-how-children-learn-new-ai-framework-learns-to-theorize-the-world-from-observations</guid></item><item><title>一种新型药物将有助于对抗以前无法治愈的疾病</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-new-kind-of-drug-will-help-fight-previously-untreatable-conditions</link><description>第一种与现有药物的作用方式完全不同的新一代药物已获得批准。专栏作家迈克尔·勒佩奇表示，这种方法可以改变各种病症的治疗方法&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-new-kind-of-drug-will-help-fight-previously-untreatable-conditions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:59:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-new-kind-of-drug-will-help-fight-previously-untreatable-conditions</guid></item><item><title>科学家破译 T 细胞如何在接触点感知敌人（例如癌症）</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-decipher-how-t-cells-sense-enemies-such-as-cancer-at-point-of-contact</link><description>T 细胞与潜在靶标之间的每次相遇（尤其是当该靶标是正在发育的肿瘤时）都始于一系列快速的分子决策。在几秒钟内，免疫细胞必须决定是发起攻击还是停止攻击。 T 细胞非常强大，具有潜在的破坏性，误判情况可能会导致严重的组织损伤。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-decipher-how-t-cells-sense-enemies-such-as-cancer-at-point-of-contact.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:44:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-decipher-how-t-cells-sense-enemies-such-as-cancer-at-point-of-contact</guid></item><item><title>詹姆斯·马丁：我们可以控制加速技术</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/james-martin-we-can-control-accelerating-technology</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/james-martin-we-can-control-accelerating-technology2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:29:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/james-martin-we-can-control-accelerating-technology</guid></item><item><title>科学家正在利用人工智能设计 CRISPR 基因编辑器</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-are-designing-crispr-gene-editors-with-ai</link><description>为了让 CRISPR 更好地发挥作用，研究人员正在转向 DeepMind 的 AlphaFold 等算法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-are-designing-crispr-gene-editors-with-ai.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:14:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-are-designing-crispr-gene-editors-with-ai</guid></item><item><title>单剂量在数小时内逆转了成年小鼠的自闭症样症状</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-single-dose-reversed-autismlike-symptoms-in-adult-mice-within-hours</link><description>一种药物短暂地逆转了成年小鼠类似自闭症的大脑和行为变化，这表明受影响的大脑回路可能仍然具有惊人的适应性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-single-dose-reversed-autismlike-symptoms-in-adult-mice-within-hours.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 11:59:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-single-dose-reversed-autismlike-symptoms-in-adult-mice-within-hours</guid></item><item><title>传染性鱼癌泛滥新英格兰湖</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/contagious-fish-cancer-overruns-new-england-lake</link><description>遗传学研究表明，鲶鱼黑色素瘤是鱼类传染性癌症的第一个例子&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/contagious-fish-cancer-overruns-new-england-lake2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 11:44:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/contagious-fish-cancer-overruns-new-england-lake</guid></item><item><title>非阿贝尔电场中的颤动光子</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/trembling-photons-in-non-abelian-electric-fields</link><description>可以制作一圈光纤来承载源自高能物理领域的现象。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/trembling-photons-in-non-abelian-electric-fields2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 11:29:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/trembling-photons-in-non-abelian-electric-fields</guid></item><item><title>物理学家首次捕获 Floquet 拓扑状态的直接证据</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/physicists-capture-first-direct-evidence-of-a-floquet-topological-state</link><description>一项新研究&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/physicists-capture-first-direct-evidence-of-a-floquet-topological-state.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 11:14:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/physicists-capture-first-di